# Normalize line endings (added 2026-08-13).
#
# WHY: this repo had no .gitattributes and the machine has core.autocrlf=true, so
# every checkout wrote CRLF while Prettier writes LF — leaving `format:check`
# failing and `git status` showing scores of files as modified with ZERO content
# difference. It cost time in several stories and made one full-repo restore look
# like a 105-file change. `eol=lf` makes the working tree match what Prettier and
# CI expect, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
